Parts of follow/ are Python ports of, or are written against, code from the
upstream Microduck project (https://github.com/MHDuck/microduck, Apache-2.0):
  - follow/tracker.py and follow/safety.py: ported from vision_follow (core.js)
  - follow/vision/exposure.py: ported from mediad's auto-exposure
  - follow/robotd_client.py, follow/posture.py: written against the robotd
    JSON-RPC protocol (duck-ipc-proto), upstream rev a9be46e
The upstream sources are not included in this repository.
